      "japanese": "この{桃|もも}はまだ{熟|う}れていない。",
      "english": "This peach is not ripe yet.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "30499_ureru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{熟|う}れた{果物|くだもの}は{甘|あま}いが{傷|いた}みやすいので、{早|はや}めに{食|た}べたほうがいい。",
      "english": "Ripe fruit is sweet but spoils easily, so it is better to eat it soon.",
      "sense_numbers": [
